  "description": "When corporate director Seo Woohyun goes on a blind date with journalist Lee Byul, love is not on his mind. Nonetheless, charmed by her eccentric personality, he soon finds himself in bed with her. But when Byul suddenly disappears, Woohyun tracks her down at an abandoned hotel that his company plans to develop. To his surprise, it’s a hangout for stray cats, a handsome young actor… and Byul! With the hotel rights and Byul now firmly in his clutches, Woohyun isn’t going to let her go this time.\n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes 15 extra chapters.*",
